  <div class="post-content"><p>When you have a business in Las Vegas, filing taxes isn't as simple as it is for an employee. There are different forms, specific deductions, and different deadlines. A tax preparer who specializes in businesses and speaks Spanish can be the difference between paying the right amount and overpaying — or making mistakes the IRS catches later.</p><h2>What is a tax preparer?</h2><p>A tax preparer is the certified professional who prepares and files your tax return with the IRS. Unlike a general accountant, a tax preparer specializes in the filing process and knows exactly which forms to use based on your type of business.</p><h2>What does a business tax preparer do?</h2><p>A business tax preparer reviews all of your income and expenses for the year, identifies every deduction that applies to your business, completes the correct forms based on your legal structure, files your return with the IRS on time, and makes sure you don't pay more taxes than you owe.</p><h2>When do you need a tax preparer for your business?</h2><p>You need a professional tax preparer when you have an LLC, S-Corp, or any type of registered business, when your business income exceeds $20,000 a year, when you have employees and handle payroll, when you receive a letter from the IRS related to your return, or when you filed on your own last year and aren't sure you did it correctly.</p><h2>What sets a good tax preparer apart?</h2><p>Not all tax preparers have the same level of experience. A good Spanish-speaking business tax preparer knows current tax law, has experience with your type of business, explains every decision clearly in your language, and is available if the IRS has questions after filing.</p><h2>What happens if you use a tax preparer without business experience?</h2><p>A tax preparer without business experience can use the wrong forms, miss important deductions, or report income incorrectly. The consequences can include penalties, additional payments to the IRS, and even audits that cost time and money.</p><h2>At Guzman Tax Accounting, we're your Spanish-speaking tax preparer</h2><p>At Guzman Tax Accounting, we prepare your business taxes in Las Vegas accurately and in Spanish. We know every deduction available for LLCs, S-Corps, and sole proprietors — and we make sure you pay exactly what you owe, no more and no less. Call us at (725) 340-6758 or reach out on WhatsApp.</p><a href="/en/consultation" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:8px;">Get a Consultation</a></div>
